["**First** (real / likely future)","if + present (also *should*, *were to*, *will* for willingness)","will / shall / can / may / must / might / imperative","*If you **should** see him, give him this.* (unlikely but possible) · *If you **will** wait, I'll call him.* (= are willing to) · *If he **comes**, tell me.*"],
["**Second** (unreal / improbable present or future)","if + past (***were* for all persons**); *were to* + base","would / could / might + base","*If I **were** you, I **would** accept.* · *If he **were to** come, we **could** begin.* · *If I **had** wings, I **could** fly.*"],
