("ul",[
"**First conditional** shifts after a past reporting verb: *He said, 'If it rains, I will stay.'* → *He said that if it **rained**, he **would stay**.*",
"**Second and third conditionals** do **not change**: *'If I were rich, I would help.'* → *He said that if he **were** rich, he **would help**.* · *'If I had known, I would have come.'* → *He said that if he **had known**, he **would have come**.*",
"**Zero conditional / general truths** do not change: *The teacher said that if you **heat** ice, it **melts**.*"]),
